LibDOM -- an implementation of the W3C DOM
==========================================

Overview
--------

LibDOM is an implementation of the W3C DOM API in C.


Requirements
------------

LibDOM depends on LibParserUtils, LibWapcaplet, and LibHubbub, all of which
are vendored alongside it in the same repo.

Building
--------

LibDOM is vendored into Besra and built as part of the top-level CMake
build (see CLAUDE.md at the repo root); it is not built or installed
standalone.

API documentation
-----------------

Currently, there is none. However, the code is well commented and the
public API may be found in the "include" directory. The testcase
sources may also be of use in working out how to use it.
